{
  "slug": "ai-brainmap",
  "name": "Ai Brainmap",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Live Context Visualizer for Claude Code — watch Claude think in real time as an interactive 2D/3D mindmap. Every user prompt, tool call and response becomes a glowing node; the tree grows additively as Claude works.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `brainmap` (Control the Brainmap live-thinking-mindmap server)\n- **Hooks** (4): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ai-brainmap@claude-community` from `Austro-Intelligence/ai-brainmap` (`plugins/ai-brainmap`).",
